{"id":"d_main_49_06","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch49","label":"Chapter 49 · Final Battle"},"label":"Acting as a Wall","stage":"49-30 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_49_05","next":"d_main_49_07","speakers":{"anis_i_w":"Anis","hongryeon_g":"Scarlet","neon_v_w":"Neon","rapunzel_s":"Rapunzel","rapi_red":"Rapi","snowwhite_h":"Snow White","leviathan":"Leviathan","behemoth":"Behemoth","ziz":"Ziz","bahamut":"Bahamut","enikk_op_l":"Enikk","burningum":"Burningum"},"icons":{"anis_i_w":"si_c017_00_s","hongryeon_g":"si_c472_00_s","neon_v_w":"si_c018_00_s","rapunzel_s":"si_c473_00_s","rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s","snowwhite_h":"si_c471_00_s","leviathan":"si_c562_00_s","behemoth":"si_c560_00_s","ziz":"si_c561_00_s","bahamut":"si_c563_00_s","enikk_op_l":"si_c904_00_s","burningum":"si_c914_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_49_06_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_1","text":"*Whooosh!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WasteLand_03","bgArt":"wasteland_03","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_chapter49_bloodrain","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_2","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_2","text":"We continue riding the wave of Dark Matter that Marian created.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WasteLand_02","bgArt":"wasteland_02","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_3","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_3","text":"We're moving at an absurd speed, with the scenery around us flying past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WasteLand_01","bgArt":"wasteland_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_4","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_4","text":"Beside us, the Rapture army presses onward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ziz","behemoth","leviathan","rapi_red","anis_i_w","neon_v_w","rapunzel_s","hongryeon_g","snowwhite_h"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_5","text":"Marian...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_6","text":"Haha. I can't believe it, even after seeing it with my own two eyes. Marian always seemed like just a kid, but now she's the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_7","text":"What meanest thou? A child? Nay, she is a woman grown, and knows well her drink.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_8","text":"Knowing how to drink is your standard for being a real adult? Interesting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_9","text":"Indeed. I taught her myself. She bears her ale straight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_10","text":"... However, let it be known I taught not her unseemly behavior in her drunkenness. That is quite another matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_11","text":"M-Marian gets drunk and unruly? What in the world did you do to her?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_12","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_13","text":"Does she still throw fits and insist on wearing her underwear over her pants?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_s","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_14","text":"Things have gotten better. Whenever she tried to do that, I'd just take them off and dress her properly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_s","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_15","text":"After watching me enough times, she's developed quite a knack for taking other people's underwear off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_s","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_16","text":"My word. Eventually, she could disrobe someone with just a flick of her finger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_s","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_17","text":"Marian has a natural gift. Honestly... how could anyone possess... such talent...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_18","text":"... Something about this conversation doesn't seem right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_19","text":"... Forget it. As long as they didn't starve her, I'd say they did a good job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_20","text":"That certainly didn't happen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_21","text":"She ate all sorts of things.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_22","text":"Spiders, centipedes, later even moss. She has remarkable survival instincts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_23","text":"You punks, what in the world did you do to Marian?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_24","text":"We merely taught her how to survive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_25","text":"She survived, and now she's the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_26","text":"As the Queen, she stands before that monster, keeping it at bay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_28","text":"That's true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_29","text":"I'm so proud of her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_30","text":"She said she couldn't hold out for long.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_31","text":"There are so many things I want to ask and say to her, but for now, let's hurry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_32","text":"We need to get to the Ark and launch a counterattack with everyone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_33","text":"... Good. Then everyone get ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_34","text":"For what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_35","text":"This wave we're riding is about die down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_36","text":"I don't know if it's because of the distance or because something happened to Marian, but the wave's cohesion is starting to weaken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_37","text":"I'll fix it. You guys go ahead to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_38","text":"You're not coming with us? I guess you still have a habit of bailing when it matters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_39","text":"We'll cut off the Raptures here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_40","text":"Also...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_41","text":"We're helping you, not the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_42","text":"You put your lives on the line for us, but the Ark didn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_43","text":"In other words, we're willing to risk our lives for you, but not for the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_44","text":"We don't exactly have any fond memories of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_45","text":"Why do you think we've gone to such great lengths to stay off the Ark's radar?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_46","text":"So this is where we go our separate ways.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_47","text":"If we go any farther, it'll start to feel like we're fighting to protect the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_48","text":"Um... That's not—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_49","text":"So anyway! Be on your way. If I'm remembering correctly, it's not far from here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_50","text":"... Okay. Let's go. I'll leave the rest to you guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_51","text":"Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_52","text":"It's too bad we won't have the Four Beasts at full strength, though I can't say I don't understand why.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_53","text":"Just cutting the enemy off here will be a big help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_54","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_54","text":"I can feel the wave Marian made losing its strength.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_55","text":"I think... this oughta do it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_56","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_56","text":"With a slosh, the wave regains its momentum.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_57","text":"Hmm. Okay. It's not as good as Marian's, but it'll take you pretty far.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_58","text":"You're quite good at this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_59","text":"Hmph. I'm a master at handling Dark Matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_60","text":"Go. We'll get off here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_61","text":"Get in touch with us when you're done, Young Man.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_62","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["bahamut"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_63","text":"I-if you see the Villain Union, tell them I say hi.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_64","text":"If you see Cecil, tell her I'm thinking of her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_65","text":"Cecil is in Eden. We're headed to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_66","text":"Ah, I was mistaken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_67","text":"Thank you for your help, Four Beasts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_g","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_68","text":"Take heed not to overtax yourselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_s","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_69","text":"See you later, brazen sisters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_70","text":"See ya.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_v_w","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_71","text":"But you'll come if we get into trouble, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["leviathan"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_72","text":"Well... We'll see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_73","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_73","text":"Thank you. We'll leave things in your hands.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_74","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_74","text":"The Four Beasts get off the wave. The distance between us grows rapidly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["bahamut"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_75","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_75","text":"Leviathan's gaze lingers as the black wave rushes away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_76","text":"What are you doing? Get ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_77","text":"Oh, right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_78","text":"Levi, wh-what's wrong?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_79","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_80","text":"If I'd been honest with them, those guys wouldn't have left.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_81","text":"We're busy right now. Marian's holding off the Queen for now, but there's no telling how long she can keep it up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_82","text":"We don't even know if the Ark is intact. We can't get through to them because of that damn signal jamming.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_83","text":"On top of that, all those Raptures are swarming toward the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_84","text":"They need to get to the Ark quickly, tell them what's going on, and bring back a bunch of reinforcements if we're going to have a fighting chance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_85","text":"That Queen... It just doesn't seem normal. There might even be two Heretics riding along inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_86","text":"We did the right thing in sending them ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_87","text":"So in summary, you're just showing off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_88","text":"B-but still, we have to deal with this situation together to have a shot at victory...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_89","text":"Hey. Don't have any faith in yourself?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_90","text":"Uh... T-to be honest, I don't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_91","text":"... We can do this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_92","text":"If anyone can do it, it's us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_93","text":"Us...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_94","text":"By us, I mean the Four Beasts, Ziz.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_95","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_49_04","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_49_04","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_96","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_96","text":"Ziz looks up at the sky.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_97","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_97","text":"Liberalio's body approaches without a sound.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_boss_eba002_phase1","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_98","text":"Um... There's three of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_99","text":"Precisely. They may not have heads, but there are three direct descendants.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_100","text":"I knew there was no way she'd make just one, but I didn't expect this many.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_101","text":"If those things make it to the Ark, that'll make matters even worse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_102","text":"We have to keep them here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_103","text":"I, the genius Bahamut, have done the math. Since it's four to three, we have a clear advantage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_104","text":"But... you can't transform, Bahamut. Doesn't that make it three-on-three?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_105","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_106","text":"I, the mighty Bahamut, will show you that transformation isn't everything when it comes to battle prowess.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"bahamut","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_107","text":"Encounter!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_108","text":"Don't use the same catchphrase as those human imposters!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_109","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_109","text":"Bahamut charges toward Liberalio's body. The other three follow close behind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_110","text":"Why not? It really gets your blood pumping.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_111","text":"Let's go!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_112","text":"O-okay!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_113","text":"No dying, everyone!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_114","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_114","text":"Inside the Central Government's main conference room in the Ark...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_chapter49_3rdreclamationwar","movie":null,"shown":["burningum"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_115","text":"A large number of Raptures are moving in the direction of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_116","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_117","text":"The units currently stationed on the surface should be sufficient to handle the situation,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_118","text":"but their numbers are so great that some are likely to breach our defensive lines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_119","text":"If the Raptures are positioned above the gate that needs to be opened when the Ark ascends,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_120","text":"it could cause a problem with the gate's opening mechanism, which could prevent the Ark from even ascending.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_121","text":"We still haven't received any word?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_122","text":"We have yet to hear from either Eden or the Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_123","text":"... For now, let's have Matis and the Ark Rangers hold the line. What about Endless and Eternity?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_124","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_124","text":"They are currently dismantling the facilities that would impede the Ark's ascent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_125","text":"We could send them into battle, but that would delay the completion of preparations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_126","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_127","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_127","text":"How are Andersen's preparations coming along?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_128","text":"They're nearly complete.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_129","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_129","text":"... All right. We'll figure something out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_130","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_130","text":"Have Endless and Eternity continue with the dismantling.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_131","type":"Speech","speaker":"burningum","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_131","text":"I have faith in Andersen and the Commander of the Counters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_49_06_132","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_49_06_132","text":"Understood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}